180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (This involves making someone doubt their memories and perceptions. It can make you feel confused, uncertain, and even crazy. Gas lighting is a toxic trait that's very common today. A person who blames you for their selfish action instead of taking accountability. Any sign of this while dating is a red flag and should be confronted because this type of behavior will seriously affect your mental health and a relationship with this kind of person will make you question your very existence. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (Emotional Blackmail)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E (This tactic involves making someone feel guilty or responsible for their actions by threatening to punish them by withdrawing affection. It can come out in several different ways, such as silent treatment, no hugs or kisses, etc. If the person you are dating decides not to call you for an entire day because of a disagreement, that is a red flag that will be even bigger later in the relationship, and it's best to address that now. Maturity is being able to not withhold affection even if the person you are interested in might offend you.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (Triangulation )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (This is when the person you are dating brings a third party into the dating and it is no longer a straight line but a triangle so instead of seeing eye to eye with the person you are dating you speak to this other person to get through to the person you are dating. have you ever dated someone and it felt like you were dating their friend too? how exhausting that can be and it sets the stage for other individuals to get involved in your relationship or even marriage.  Remember dating sets the stage for the relationship so whatever is allowed in dating will be very hard to stop in marriage. while it is not bad to get council and hear opinions it is vital to make sure you are seeing eye to eye with the person you are dating. the risk of the third party also means the door is open for this person to take advantage of the dating situation to make you even fall for them. The third-party could be jealous of the entire relationship and seek to ruin it before it can become anything substantial.  )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
