/E (Emotionally immature indicates difficulty in managing emotions and handling challenging situations. If you are dealing with someone who is emotionally immature, patience and clear communication are key ways to get your point across. If you are working on your emotional growth, then self-reflection and seeking guidance from a mentor or therapist will be really helpful. )
/Pg 24 0 R
