/P 140 0 R
/E (Frequent outbursts are one way to tell if someone is emotionally immature. Being a hothead might seem cute to some people, but for those looking to create a life that flourishes, that's a huge red flag. Emotional immaturity is a shut door that prevents critical thinking, and communication from entering.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
