203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 141 0 R
/E (Emotionally Immature people have a hard time self-regulating. Difficulty managing their emotions leads to frequent outbursts and potentially aggressive behavior. When you hear of cases of individuals abusing their spouse constantly this is the flag the victims failed to identify \(emotional immaturity\). Everything is an argument with someone who walks around with this red flag. This is also why bringing up the topic of therapy on dates is important because many people are still stuck at the age they experienced some level of trauma and it has not been addressed. Unresolved trauma can cause someone in their 40s to act like the 20-year-old version of them that got hurt.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
