206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (This is very serious and should not be taken lightly. A relationship is about serving and catering to the person you choose to be with. A person who lacks empathy will dismiss your feelings. Being self-centered that person will put their needs first without considering your perspective or well-being. A person with no empathy will lack accountability and will not take responsibility for their action, which means getting an apology is not happening at least not a sincere apology. Even the criminal we accuse of being guilty still has his day in court for him/her to be heard so everyone wants to be heard. Whoever you are dating has the potential to affect your mood for the entire day so ignoring this red flag means you'll be one of the people who starts most of their days at 8 AM already upset because of what was said or what wasn't said the night before.    )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (These little red flags become bigger the longer you ignore them and this is why it's crucial to be able to identify them from the dating stage. Too many people rush to date and head to the bedroom before they even get to know the person they are dating. If that person does not value your feelings in dating what makes you think what you have to say will matter after a trip to the bed room? )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
