211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/E (It's a feeling too many people ignore when dating. You might not have been able to identify the red flags in the past but your gut could see what the brain could not and sadly most people brush this off then see the red flags too late. Your intuition is very much needed when dating because it is the compass that's going to help you navigate your dating life. What happens when you ignore the GPS direction? you get lost or end up having to turn back and that's time wasted. The truth is some people are really good at hiding the red flags but if you follow that gut feeling you'll know something is off even if you can't pinpoint it. That's enough to keep you on high alert or allow you to walk away and not take it any further. someone can have a nice face and a nice body but a terrible heart with bad intentions and if you can start to value what your gut is saying then you stand a better chance at avoiding these kinds of people.    )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [0]
>>
