538 0 obj
<<
/Title (Knowing yourself and your values is essential in identifying red flags. Understanding what you want in a relationship and what your deal-breakers are allows you to recognize behaviors that don't align with your expectations. A caterpillar might look like a worm because they are both crawling but the caterpillar situation is temporary. This is why it is important to know yourself and know what you are about so you can avoid tying yourself to a worm while in your caterpillar stage of life. this isn't to say the worm is bad but the worm isn't going where you are. The worm is comfortable on the ground and it's ok with crawling for the rest of its life caterpillars not)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 474 0 R
>>
endobj
